IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `br-core`
IMPORT `br3-nomes`
IMPORT `br3-seat`

-- br3-cases-seat.l4 -- worked cases of the seat layer: for every question of br3-seat.l4, the facts a shareholder would
-- state, and the answer the text gives, written by hand from the text before running. Dates are written year first.

§ `Casos do assento do acionista`

